      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_29",
      "hash64": "82694C3D938B1A76",
      "text": "……嗯！既然如此，\\n你就用自己的双脚\\r\\n去海岸区上课吧！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
